S128 LRC14 FAREY-MEDIANT TOURNAMENT INTERFACE
==============================================================================
[Assumption challenge]
  considered vertex sets: runners, residues, Farey fractions, row families,
    optimum witness times, and proof obligations.
  chosen carriers: runner winding tournaments at t=1/14 and t=M(S), plus
    a row-level proof-priority tournament by escape height.
  preserved: Farey excess, achieved winding class, and proof ordering.
  destroyed: continuous neighborhoods away from the chosen scales.

